{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"TIA \u2014 blocks of a PLC"},"description":"Lists the blocks of a PLC (name, type, language, number, isConsistent, isKnowHowProtected). Requires a connected project. For a large project read it in pages: pass limit (1-1000), then pass the nextCursor of each page as cursor until nextCursor is null. A page is {blocks, total, nextCursor}; total is the number of blocks of the whole PLC. Without limit and cursor the whole list is returned. Maps to GET /plcs/{plc}/blocks?limit=&cursor= (both optional). Read-only (class R).","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"cursor":{"description":"the nextCursor of the previous page, passed back exactly as received; it is opaque, so never invent, build or edit one (omit it for the first page, and omit both limit and cursor for the whole list)","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"limit":{"description":"page size, an integer from 1 to 1000; pass it to read the list in pages (omit both limit and cursor for the whole list)","maximum":1000,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"plc":{"description":"PLC name","type":"string"}},"required":["plc"],"type":"object"},"name":"tia_plc_blocks","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":{},"properties":{"blocks":{"anyOf":[{"items":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":{},"properties":{"isConsistent":{"type":"boolean"},"isKnowHowProtected":{"type":"boolean"},"language":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"number":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"type":{"type":"string"}},"required":["name","type","language","number","isConsistent","isKnowHowProtected"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":{},"properties":{"chars":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"hint":{"type":"string"},"items":{"maxi